    "name": "Fluffy Kitchen Saga",
    "steam_appid": 3706590,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300aFluffy Kitchen Saga\u300b</strong> is a restaurant simulation game at the bottom of your screen. Manage your diner while working/studying/handling tasks. Serve fluffy customers dishes to earn coins, upgrade recipes, and unlock new fluffy patrons. Relaxing gameplay where fluffies accompany you daily~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706590/extras/17c5999147c55c3c379f42e8a7cc8446.poster.avif?t=1755261341\" width=800 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706590/extras/17c5999147c55c3c379f42e8a7cc8446.webm?t=1755261341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706590/extras/17c5999147c55c3c379f42e8a7cc8446.mp4?t=1755261341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features <strong>N+ themed scenes</strong> where you can unlock corresponding decorative furniture items such as dining tables, stools, cashier counters, dessert stations, coffee bars, decorations, carpets, and more! With <strong>over 50+ craftable dishes</strong>, <strong>numerous highly experienced restaurant staff</strong>, and <strong>4 mysterious customer groups totaling 100+ characters</strong>, plus <strong>multiple interactive mini-games</strong> to enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706590/extras/cda9f5b16cf2c15a3a6cd59c750be75f.poster.avif?t=1755261341\" width=800 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706590/extras/cda9f5b16cf2c15a3a6cd59c750be75f.webm?t=1755261341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706590/extras/cda9f5b16cf2c15a3a6cd59c750be75f.mp4?t=1755261341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2665Gameplay\u2665</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706590/extras/214324bf5b2bd1b70232784a46d58189.poster.avif?t=1755261341\" width=664 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706590/extras/214324bf5b2bd1b70232784a46d58189.webm?t=1755261341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serve Customers:</strong> Welcome various adorable furry customers into your restaurant\u2014kittens, puppies, bunnies, and more! They\u2019re all super cute and fluffy. Feel free to poke them if you\u2019re curious...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Dishes:</strong> Over 50+ delicious dishes (global cuisines, desserts, milk tea) are waiting to be unlocked! Serve customers, earn coins, upgrade your dishes, and attract even more fluffy new guests!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Theme Unlocks:</strong> Time to unlock new themes! Gain access to adorable new customers and decorative furniture to style up your restaurant.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restaurant Staff:</strong> Your team is made up of highly skilled professionals: leopards, front desk attendants, receptionists, cleaners, chefs, and promoters. With their help, your restaurant will thrive\u2014clean environment, tasty food, and happy customers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Feature: Daily Fortune Draw:</strong> Draw a fortune to see your luck for the day\u2014will it be &quot;Small Blessing: Meme Guardian Protection&quot; or &quot;Good Luck Today! Reverse Mercury Retrograde&quot;?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy Music:</strong> The in-game jukebox lets you play music! Discover what your fluffy customers are listening to every day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-Games:</strong> Take a break from managing your restaurant and enjoy mini-games like Blackjack, Food Fusion, and more (stay tuned!). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>P.S. Additional features are under development\u2014stay excited!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706590/extras/a344e277b547a44a44f2cb7f4fa8e523.poster.avif?t=1755261341\" width=593 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706590/extras/a344e277b547a44a44f2cb7f4fa8e523.webm?t=1755261341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >P.S. If you enjoy casual &amp; management sims, this game is for you (the world needs adorable fluffies~).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Languages: Simplified&amp;Traditional Chinese, English, Japanese.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300aFluffy Kitchen Saga\u300b</strong> is a restaurant simulation game at the bottom of your screen. Manage your diner while working/studying/handling tasks. Serve fluffy customers dishes to earn coins, upgrade recipes, and unlock new fluffy patrons. Relaxing gameplay where fluffies accompany you daily~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706590/extras/17c5999147c55c3c379f42e8a7cc8446.poster.avif?t=1755261341\" width=800 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706590/extras/17c5999147c55c3c379f42e8a7cc8446.webm?t=1755261341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706590/extras/17c5999147c55c3c379f42e8a7cc8446.mp4?t=1755261341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features <strong>N+ themed scenes</strong> where you can unlock corresponding decorative furniture items such as dining tables, stools, cashier counters, dessert stations, coffee bars, decorations, carpets, and more! With <strong>over 50+ craftable dishes</strong>, <strong>numerous highly experienced restaurant staff</strong>, and <strong>4 mysterious customer groups totaling 100+ characters</strong>, plus <strong>multiple interactive mini-games</strong> to enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706590/extras/cda9f5b16cf2c15a3a6cd59c750be75f.poster.avif?t=1755261341\" width=800 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as