ne Draw:</strong> Draw a fortune to see your luck for the day\u2014will it be &quot;Small Blessing: Meme Guardian Protection&quot; or &quot;Good Luck Today! Reverse Mercury Retrograde&quot;?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy Music:</strong> The in-game jukebox lets you play music! Discover what your fluffy customers are listening to every day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-Games:</strong> Take a break from managing your restaurant and enjoy mini-games like Blackjack, Food Fusion, and more (stay tuned!). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>P.S. Additional features are under development\u2014stay excited!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706590/extras/a344e277b547a44a44f2cb7f4fa8e523.poster.avif?t=1755261341\" width=593 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706590/extras/a344e277b547a44a44f2cb7f4fa8e523.webm?t=1755261341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >P.S. If you enjoy casual &amp; management sims, this game is for you (the world needs adorable fluffies~).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Languages: Simplified&amp;Traditional Chinese, English, Japanese.</p>",
